msgstr "Automação residencial (Home Assistant, incluído no FreedomBox)"

#: content/opt-green-handbook/handbook_web.md:716
msgid ""
"Smart TVs (Kodi, Jellyfin, [Plasma Big Screen](https://plasma-bigscreen."
"org/))"
msgstr ""
"Smart TVs (Kodi, Jellyfin, [Plasma Big Screen](https://plasma-bigscreen."
"org/))"

#: content/opt-green-handbook/handbook_web.md:717
msgid "E-book readers (KOReader)"
msgstr "Leitores de e-book (KOReader)"

#: content/opt-green-handbook/handbook_web.md:718
msgid "Garage door openers (OpenGarage, ratgdo)"
msgstr "Abridores de portas de garagem (OpenGarage, ratgdo)"

#: content/opt-green-handbook/handbook_web.md:720
msgid ""
"There are certainly other exciting projects to make your digital life fully "
"FOSS and independent. It's a big Free & Open Source Software world out there."
msgstr ""
"Certamente existem outros projetos empolgantes para tornar sua vida digital "
"totalmente FOSS e independente. É um vasto mundo de Software Livre e de "
"Código Aberto lá fora."

#: content/opt-green-handbook/handbook_web.md:722
msgid ""
"![Plasma Mobile is an open-source user interface for mobile devices "
"developed by the KDE community. (Image from KDE released under a [CC-BY-4.0]"
"(https://spdx.org/licenses/CC-BY-4.0.html) license.)](images/"
